@startuml
' What: how the Fate engine (own code) touches Unciv (D-41, D-43).
' Shows: read-only sources, the one write path (temporaryUniques), the known hook (Pride)
'        and the hooks still to be placed (generation clock, Choice of Fate screen, saving the soul state).
' Source: brainstorming-base.md, D-43, D-44, D-49, D-50, §4 Engine notes. Open: Q-46 (soul state in the save).
title Fate engine and Unciv: reads, writes, hooks
package "Own code (Gdx-independent core)" {
  component "Fate engine" as FE
}
package "Unciv (upstream)" {
  component "getStatForRanking, statsForNextTurn,\ngetStatMapForNextTurn, hasExplored" as READ
  component "Civilization.temporaryUniques" as TU
  component "TechManager.getScienceModifier" as TM
  component "Turn loop" as TL
  component "World screen UI" as UI
  component "Save file" as SV
}
FE --> READ : reads, no change
FE --> TU : injects policy,\nclimate, symptoms
TM ..> FE : hook: Pride factor
TL ..> FE : hook: generation clock\n(to be placed)
UI ..> FE : hook: Choice of Fate screen\n(to be placed)
FE ..> SV : soul state\n(open: Q-46)
@enduml
